{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08582","headline":"与从侄杭州刺史良游天竺寺 · 李白","name":"与从侄杭州刺史良游天竺寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"挂席凌蓬丘，观涛憩樟楼。\n三山动逸兴，五马同遨游。\n天竺森在眼，松风飒惊秋。\n览云测变化，弄水穷清幽。\n叠嶂隔遥海，当轩写归流。\n诗成傲云月，佳趣满吴洲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08582.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08582","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}